{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711180/extras/d654c6222a5bce77679fa3d3193fc87d.gif?t=1769956484\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711180/extras/d654c6222a5bce77679fa3d3193fc87d.poster.avif?t=1769956484\" class=\"bb_img\" alt=\"Pink axolotl next to text that reads &amp;quot;Play now&amp;quot;\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as John Axolotl in this flash style game where you collect orange fishies for dashes, red hearts for health, and treasure chests for extra points. All while avoiding enemies and obstacles in your way towards the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711180/extras/4efbfeee42aeaecd43b55f8214e2a7ab.avif?t=1769956484\" alt=\"Eel shooting electricity next to text that reads &amp;quot;Features&amp;quot;\" width=608 height=112 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exclusive single-player endless mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local multiplayer Mini-game &amp; endless mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711180/extras/eaa4364091627345dd67bb5d348cf5f5.poster.avif?t=1769956484\" aria-label=\"Various axolotl characters with different cosmetics next to text that reads &amp;quot;CUSTOMIZE!&amp;quot;\" width=608 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711180/extras/eaa4364091627345dd67bb5d348cf5f5.webm?t=1769956484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use points you earn from playing the game to buy different clothing items to wear inside the shop! Unlock different colors for your axolotl by completing achievements. Each achievement gives you a unique color scheme to swap to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711180/extras/c332c68146bb9087eb749cb7480ac9e6.apng?t=1769956484\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711180/extras/c332c68146bb9087eb749cb7480ac9e6.poster.avif?t=1769956484\" class=\"bb_img\" alt=\"Singing bass flopping its tail\" width=559 height=280 /></picture></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Axolotl Swam","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3711180/ad886ab9a423027daef5e88b5e5b0d490d79128f.jpg"},{"name":"Tortoise and the Hare","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3711180/500a1645b3c2f7fdc442c9e95a4e9660e51e7ef5.jpg"},{"name":"Neoteny Salamander","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3711180/ee3f41003b86d3602c4dd970eef105f43bd483d0.jpg"},{"name":"Cowboy Axolotl","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3711180/1b4a0476b57a97d59477d7da0d64dd5657c8e404.jpg"},{"name":"Better than the dev","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3711180/12f3ad58a24275c1c53f1158714f1a7357eee7d1.jpg"},{"name":"Scratch ticket addict","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3711180/8ef3bba096cc7ec5f2c818660307aa5d76338db7.jpg"},{"name":"Tortoise bet win","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3711180/8767afb77c13efac8c54a3aaa2ee9bdac48d0c17.jpg"},{"name":"Another fishing minigame","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3711180/9b0660c165ceddd21f986d90b7403ad1ba6d8ebc.